{"title": "Forced Manoeuvre (Condition)", "pageid": 14398, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Forced_Manoeuvre_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has tick type", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Forced_Manoeuvre_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Forced_Manoeuvre_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Forced_Manoeuvre_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Forced_Manoeuvre_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Forced_Manoeuvre_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Forced_Manoeuvre_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Forced Manoeuvre Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Forced_Manoeuvre_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Forced_Manoeuvre_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/4/42/Forced_Manoeuvre_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Forced Manoeuvre</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Movement_speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement speed\">Movement speed</a> increased by 4.5 m (15 ft) and doesn't provoke <a href=\"/wiki/Opportunity_Attack\" title=\"Opportunity Attack\">Opportunity Attacks</a>. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">HALF_MOVEMENT</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CHALF_MOVEMENT%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CHALF_MOVEMENT%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Duration\" title=\"Conditions\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Loses duration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Duration\" title=\"Conditions\">Loses duration</a>: end of turn</div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>The in-game tooltip says this increases movement speed by half, but it actually increases it by a fixed 4.5 m (15 ft).</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Forced_Manoeuvre\">Sources of Forced Manoeuvre</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Forced_Manoeuvre\" title=\"Forced Manoeuvre\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Forced_Manoeuvre_Icon.webp/30px-Forced_Manoeuvre_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Forced_Manoeuvre_Icon.webp/45px-Forced_Manoeuvre_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Forced_Manoeuvre_Icon.webp/60px-Forced_Manoeuvre_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Forced Manoeuvre\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Forced_Manoeuvre_Icon.webp/30px-Forced_Manoeuvre_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/78/Forced_Manoeuvre_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Forced_Manoeuvre\" title=\"Forced Manoeuvre\">Forced Manoeuvre</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714234359\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.039 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.042 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1297/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 16922/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4526/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.019/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 977147/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   36.776      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   36.776      1 -total\n 55.18%   20.294      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 28.38%   10.438      2 Template:Condition_sources\n 16.77%    6.167      3 Template:Icon_link\n 15.69%    5.770      3 Template:Icon_text\n 14.76%    5.429     15 Template:Trim\n 14.54%    5.347      1 Template:Condition_sources/format\n 13.91%    5.